          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu kiseera ekyo, amagumba ga bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya, n'ag'abakungu ba Buyudaaya, n'aga bakabona, n'ag'abalanzi, n'ag'abantu abandi ab'omu Yerusalemu, gaja kutoolebwa mu magombe gaago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaja kusansaanira buli ghantu, ghansi gh'endhuba, n'omwezi, n'emuunienie dhoonadhoona edh'oku igulu. Ebyo n'ebintu, abantu abo bye baagonzanga, ni babijiirangaku, ni babigheerezanga era ni babisinzanga. Era amagumba gaibwe ago tigaja kusolozebwa waire okuziikibwa, aye gaja kubanga ku itaka okwo ng'oti busa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boonaboona ab'omu ighanga lino eibi, abaliwonagho eyo yoonayoona ye ndiba mbabingiire, balyegomba okufa okusinga okuba abalamu. Nze Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
